Apologies for the direct pings, unsure on how to request feedback on a PR. Would love some guidance!

Thank you!

You can already do this:
```
"my-custom-provider": {
      "api": "https://my-provider.api.io/inference",
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "models": {
        "gpt-4.1": {},
        "gpt-5.3-codex": {
          "provider": {
            "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai",
          },
        },
      },
    },
```

When u use the openai-compatible provider it only supports completions, if u want to use responses u need to use ai-sdk/openai instead, just make sure the url is setup correctly.

U can override the baseline provider settings per model (see ex)
